# Force LF in the working tree for this subtree regardless of the machine's
# core.autocrlf setting. Biome's formatter expects LF, and without this a
# branch switch on Windows silently rewrites these files to CRLF, breaking
# `npm run lint` on files that were committed clean.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
